# Baseline PNGs are deliberately NOT ignored.
# Excluding them makes `--update-snapshots` a local convenience: the gate then
# passes on any machine because it has nothing to compare against, and fails on CI
# because its baselines do not exist. A visual gate that is not in version control
# is not a gate.
